\f0\b vMotion
\f1\b0 , 
\f0\b vSAN
\f1\b0  (required). Optional third: 
\f0\b vSAN Witness
\f1\b0 . When vSAN Witness is omitted, mgmt (vmk0) is tagged with vSAN witness traffic in addition to mgmt; when present, a dedicated witness VMkernel (vmk3) is created. Each entry: 
\f2 service
\f1 , 
\f2 vlanId
\f1  (0\'964095), 
\f2 netmask
\f1  (valid IPv4 netmask), 
\f2 ipList
\f1  (exactly two unique IPv4s, one per host). Only the 
\f0\b vSAN Witness
\f1\b0  entry requires 
\f2 gateway
\f1  (VMkernel interfaces are not configured with a gateway by the script).\
