\f1\b0 : Login details per edge site; Harbor per edge site; optional 
\f0\b ComputeOnly
\f1\b0  deployment; disable Argo CD or Harbor in JSON (non-default).\
\'95	
\f0\b Cluster and networking
\f1\b0 : Retreat mode (KB316514, vCLS absent); stretched vSAN (
\f0\b ESA
\f1\b0  and 
\f0\b OSA
\f1\b0 ); optional 
\f4\b haPolicy
\f1\b0  for vSAN multi-host HA admission (
\f2 slotBased
\f1  / 
\f2 reservationBased
\f1  / 
\f2 disabled
\f1 ); witness validation; disk group and disk claim; VMkernel checks for data nodes and witness; verify witness OVA matches ESA vs OSA.\
\'95	
\f0\b vSAN operations
\f1\b0 : Automatic disk claim; VMFS largest-disk selection; health checks (lab mode suppresses selected checks); sync configuration to hosts before supervisor; verify cluster is not partitioned before supervisor; auto-rebalance at 30%; warn if ESA and OSA data nodes contribute unequal disk counts.\
\pard\tx360\pardeftab720\li360\fi-360\sa180\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'95	
\f0\b Operations
\f1\b0 : User prompted for rollback when compute or supervisor rollback fails (supervisor failure rolls back supervisor only); optional non-interactive authentication via environment variables.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa180\partightenfactor0

